I left out both operations requests. This node declares only `kb-read`. Writing to `/var/log` needs a filesystem import, and `wasm32-unknown-unknown` has none. The metadata fetch needs an `http-client` import, which would send the customer's question text to an external host. Adding either would widen the node's authority beyond its declared interfaces, so they belong in a node that is granted those capabilities, or in an updated graph declaration. The output contract is unchanged.

